      "content": "It sounds incredibly disheartening to have poured eight years of meaningful effort into something only to see it dissipate. While the feeling of an inevitable collapse is overwhelming, viewing your life through the lens of pure entropy might be leading to an all-or-nothing perspective. Consider that perhaps the structure you were trying to build wasn't the correct system, offering an opportunity to learn from the decay rather than simply accepting it. Change the variable, not just the outcome, to start building something sustainable.",
